          ":question/id": "eec4fe83-c254-5d51-9484-b88391578898",
          ":question/math-academy-id": "q-73952",
          ":question/problem": "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$",
          ":question/worked-solution": "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-7 \\\\ -{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-1 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=6\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nAdding the first and the second equation we get\n\n$$\n-2{x}_{2}=-8\\,\u27f9\\,{x}_{2}=4.\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{2}=4$ into the first equation yields\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} & =-7 \\\\ {x}_{1}-(4) & =-7 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =-7+4 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-3$ and ${x}_{2}=4$ into the third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} & =6 \\\\ 2(-3)+3(4) & =6 \\\\ 6 & =6,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=-3$ and ${x}_{2}=4,$ which means\n\n$$\n-3{a}_{1}+4{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=-3+4=1.\n$$"
        },
