          ":question/id": "e9e20ff9-23b3-5457-a430-304f98c0d839",
          ":question/math-academy-id": "q-73950",
          ":question/problem": "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -14\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$",
          ":question/worked-solution": "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -14\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1} \\\\ 4{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -14\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -14\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} &=-11 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=8 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} &=-14\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nAdding the second and the third equations we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6{x}_{1} & =-6 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =-1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we substitute into the second equation to get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} & =8 \\\\ 4(-1)+3{x}_{2} & =8 \\\\ 3{x}_{2} & =12 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=4$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} & =-11 \\\\ 3(-1)-2(4) & =-11 \\\\ -11 & =-11,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=4,$ which means\n\n$$\n-{a}_{1}+4{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=-1+4=3.\n$$"
